{
  "name": "VISAI — CRM Clientes (Upsert)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-info",
      "name": "Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VISAI — CRM Clientes\n\n**Webhook:** POST `/webhook/visai-crm-cliente`\n\n**Payload del backend:**\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"user@email.com\",\n  \"analysis_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"cortes\": [\"Fade lateral\", \"Drop fade\"],\n  \"barber_code\": \"BARBER01\",\n  \"importe\": 12.39,\n  \"marketing_consent\": true,\n  \"result_url\": \"https://visaiapp.com/result/uuid\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-05-13T...\"\n}\n```\n\n**Flujo:**\n1. Busca si el cliente ya existe por email\n2. Si existe → actualiza cortes + importe\n3. Si no existe → crea persona nueva\n4. Si hay barber_code → busca/crea la barbería y la vincula",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook — VISAI Backend",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 540],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "visai-crm-cliente",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "visai-crm-cliente-webhook"
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-payload",
      "name": "Parse Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [420, 540],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\n\nconst email = (body.email || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nif (!email) throw new Error('email requerido');\n\nconst cortes = body.cortes || [];\nconst cortesStr = Array.isArray(cortes) ? cortes.join(' · ') : String(cortes);\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    email,\n    analysis_id: body.analysis_id || '',\n    cortes_str: cortesStr,\n    barber_code: (body.barber_code || '').toUpperCase().trim(),\n    importe: body.importe || 0,\n    marketing_consent: body.marketing_consent === true || body.marketing_consent === 'true',\n    result_url: body.result_url || '',\n    created_at: body.created_at || new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      }
    },
